# The installer image (tools/installer/Dockerfile) gets only authored source:
# everything is excluded, then the source folders are allowed back. ROMs, local/
# (private inputs and game-derived output), third_party/ and Git data never enter it.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!Makefile
!LICENSE
!cmake/
!native/
!tools/
**/*.[zZ]64
**/*.[vV]64
**/*.[nN]64
**/*.[rR][oO][mM]
**/__pycache__
